msgstr "'Bicho' de comunicaciones colocado incorrectamente.\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_055"
msgid "Obtain CamSpy.\n"
msgstr "Obtén la Cámara Espía.\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_056"
msgid "Dr. Caroll's\n"
msgstr "Dr. Caroll:\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_057"
msgid "CamSpy\n"
msgstr "Cámara Espía\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_058"
msgid "A CamSpy\n"
msgstr "Una Camára Espía\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_059"
msgid "Picked up a CamSpy.\n"
msgstr "Cámara Espía obtenida.\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_060"
msgid ""
"There's no way through while those \n"
"lasers are active.\n"
msgstr ""
"No hay ningún camino posible mientras \n"
"esos láseres estén activos.\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_061"
msgid ""
"That must be the meeting room up ahead. \n"
"Time to use the CamSpy.\n"
msgstr ""
"Eso de ahí delante debe ser la sala de reuniones. \n"
"Hora de usar la Cámara Espía.\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_062"
msgid ""
"The safe's heavily encrypted. \n"
"The decoder's gonna take a little longer.\n"
msgstr ""
"La caja fuerte está fuertemente encriptada. \n"
"El decodificador va a tomarse su tiempo.\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_063"
msgid ""
"Time to leave! Let's get to the door I set \n"
"up earlier.\n"
msgstr ""
"¡Hora de irse! Vamos a la puerta que creé \n"
"antes.\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_064"
msgid "Mission critical object destroyed.\n"
msgstr "Objeto crítico de la misión destruido.\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_065"
msgid ""
"Stand back, Joanna. We'll create your escape \n"
"route.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aparta, Joanna. Crearemos tu ruta \n"
"de escape.\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_066"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_067"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_068"
msgid "Detonator\n"
msgstr "Detonador\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_069"
msgid "Detonator\n"
msgstr "Detonador\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_070"
msgid "Picked up Detonator.\n"
msgstr "Detonador obtenido.\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_071"
msgid "CamSpy has been destroyed - abort mission.\n"
msgstr "La Cámara Espía ha sido destruida: abortar misión.\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_072"
msgid ""
"We've recovered the sapient from Carrington \n"
"and altered its programming. It no longer \n"
"has a personality, so there will be no \n"
"further incidents.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hemos recuperado la IA de manos de Carrington \n"
"y alterado su programación. Nunca más tendrá \n"
"personalidad, así no podrá haber posibles \n"
"futuros incidentes.\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_073"
msgid ""
"This will reduce its efficiency. My team will \n"
"have to take it to the core themselves. This \n"
"will endanger them. You should have \n"
"anticipated that the sapient might develop \n"
"a troublesome moral code.\n"
msgstr ""
"Esto reducirá su eficiencia. Mi equipo tendrá \n"
"que llevarlo al núcleo por sí mismo. Esto les \n"
"pondrá en peligro. Debías haber anticipado \n"
"que la IA podría desarrollar un problemático \n"
"código moral.\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_074"
msgid ""
"No one could have predicted that! And I \n"
"resent being singled out for blame! \n"
"What about him?\n"
msgstr ""
"¡Nadie podría haber predecido eso! ¡Y me \n"
"molesta que me echen la culpa de ello! \n"
"¿Qué pasa con él?\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_075"
msgid ""
"The President turned down your request for \n"
"the loan of the Pelagic II?\n"
msgstr ""
"¿El Presidente no ha admitido tu petición \n"
"de préstamo del Pelagic II?\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_076"
msgid ""
"Could it be you overestimated your \n"
"influence over him?\n"
msgstr ""
"¿No podría ser que hayas sobreestimado \n"
"tu influencia sobre él?\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_077"
msgid ""
"No! Perhaps I underestimated his resolve. \n"
"We have a contingency plan ready to go, \n"
"and we will move as soon as the Presidential \n"
"entourage arrives at the air base. All I \n"
"need from the President is a tissue sample.\n"
msgstr ""
"¡No! Quizá haya menospreciado su resolución. \n"
"Tenemos un plan de contigencia preparado, \n"
"y comenzará tan pronto como el séquito presidencial\n"
"llegue a la base aérea. Todo lo que necesito del \n"
"Presidente es una muestra de tejido cutáneo.\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_078"
msgid ""
"Ha! Assuming you don't get any interference. \n"
"If Carrington has pieced together enough of \n"
"this, he will have called for reinforcements.\n"
msgstr ""
"¡Ja! Eso asumiendo que no sufras interferencias. \n"
"Si Carrington ha recabado suficientes piezas de \n"
"esto, seguro que avisará a los refuerzos.\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_079"
msgid ""
"There will be no outside help for \n"
"Mr. Carrington. The technology you gave us \n"
"is installed in Nevada and fully operational. \n"
"We can intercept any craft they use.\n"
msgstr ""
"No habrá ayuda exterior para el Sr. Carrington. \n"
"La tecnología que nos diste está instalada en \n"
"Nevada y es totalmente operativa. \n"
"Podemos interceptar cualquier nave que usen.\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_080"
msgid ""
"Then the devices we gave you are working \n"
"correctly? Good. Because we believe \n"
"anything which does not work correctly \n"
"should be destroyed. Consider that as you \n"
"follow your 'backup plans.'\n"
msgstr ""
"¿Entonces los dispositivos que os dimos funcionan \n"
"correctamente? Bien. Porque nosotros creemos que \n"
"cualquier cosa que no funcione correctamente debe \n"
"ser destruida. Tenlo en cuenta para tus 'planes \n"
"alternativos'.\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_081"
msgid ""
"Agent Dark reporting in! Prepare to \n"
"receive a download of the meeting data. \n"
"Priority request for an Institute Support \n"
"Team to protect the President before he \n"
"goes to Alaska.\n"
msgstr ""
"¡Agente Dark informando! Preparaos para \n"
"recibir los datos de la reunión. \n"
"Petición prioritaria de un Equipo de Soporte \n"
"del Instituto para proteger al Presidente \n"
"antes de que vaya a Alaska.\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_082"
msgid ""
"No time for that now, Agent Dark. There's \n"
"been a development during radio silence. \n"
"The craft carrying those 'friends' I was \n"
"talking about was shot down over Nevada. \n"
"The weapon responsible was fired from \n"
"Area 51... that's where the survivors and \n"
"debris will have been taken. You're to \n"
"prep for immediate dispatch when you \n"
"return here. Carrington out.\n"
msgstr ""
"No hay tiempo para eso ahora, Agente Dark. Se \n"
"ha progresado durante el silencio de radio. \n"
"La nave que llevaba a esos 'amigos' de los \n"
"que te hablaba, fue derribada sobre Nevada. \n"
"El arma responsable fue disparada desde el\n"
"Área 51... Allí es donde los supervivientes \n"
"y los restos del siniestro han sido llevados. \n"
"Debes prepararte para ser enviada de inmediato \n"
"en cuanto regreses aquí. Carrington fuera.\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_083"
msgid "Area 51? But what about the President?\n"
msgstr "¿Al Área 51? ¿Pero qué pasa con el Presidente?\n"
